OL,3,GNEWSAMore 'family homes' planned for
OL,4,ASeven Sisters estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily homes, townhouses and flats
OL,7,Fsurrounded by green spaces is the
OL,8,Fvision for the new social housing
OL,9,Festate set to replace Rochdale's Seven
OL,10,FSisters tower blocks once they have
OL,11,Fbeen demolished.
OL,13,FAbout 600 homes will be built on the
OL,14,FCollege Bank estate, with a "very
OL,15,Fgreen" environment and "plenty of
OL,16,Fparking", Rochdale Boroughwide Housing
OL,17,F(RBH) said.
OL,19,FRBH announced earlier this week that it
OL,20,Fwould demolish the seven towers that
OL,21,Fhave dominated the town's skyline since
OL,22,Fthe 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
