OL,3,GNEWSAMore 'family homes' planned for
OL,4,ASeven Sisters estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents had staged a 10-year campaign
OL,7,Fagainst the demolition but the housing
OL,8,Ffirm said it would have cost #269m and
OL,9,Ftaken 12 years to refurbish them.
